  "content": "<h1>PackCore</h1>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpackcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/c7fd18efdadd1c3f12ae56b49afd834640d2d797/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"於Modrinth下載\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要Fabric API\"></a> <img src=\"https://github.com/KdGaming0/PackCore/actions/workflows/build.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"構建狀態\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fpackcore\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/packcore?color=00AF5C&amp;label=downloads&amp;logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth下載量\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>PackCore是專為SkyBlock類模組包打造的設定與配置伴侶模組。</strong><br>\n它能協助您快速套用正確設定、保持配置井然有序，並輕鬆切換預設配置。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>PackCore的功能（v4版）</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>首次啟動設定精靈</strong>，附有視覺預覽</li>\n<li><strong>簡易風格選擇</strong>：選單、標籤設計、儲存介面、物品背景等</li>\n<li><strong>效能設定檔選擇器</strong>（從最高FPS到畫質優先）</li>\n<li><strong>選用整合功能</strong>：當安裝相容模組時自動顯示</li>\n<li><strong>資源包選擇</strong>：直接在精靈中選取</li>\n<li><strong>一鍵套用流程</strong>：最終確認頁面後才進行變更</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>第4版新增功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>全新的<strong>多頁歡迎精靈</strong>，引導流程更清晰</li>\n<li>新的<strong>配置管理畫面</strong>，含分頁功能：<ul>\n<li><strong>配置</strong>（官方預設 + 您匯出的個人預設）</li>\n<li><strong>匯出</strong>（從選定檔案自訂配置包）</li>\n<li><strong>匯入</strong>（從匯入資料夾載入配置壓縮檔）</li>\n<li><strong>備份</strong>（安全建立與還原備份）</li></ul></li>\n<li>更佳的<strong>預設切換流程</strong>，採用重新啟動安全的套用邏輯</li>\n<li>更簡潔的使用體驗：進度條、狀態列與套用確認</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>截圖</h2>\n<p>&lt;details&gt; &lt;summary&gt;劇透&lt;/summary&gt;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/9d5e0aea01e6a172db4fae0f1e5b84298df26e52_0.webp\" alt=\"歡迎精靈\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ce96d20952d72c9c1b96536371c36b6cd93d64bf.jpeg\" alt=\"主選單2\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dcc548c5174059c8936e296eb7a85a8a2ce7b89a.png\" alt=\"配置管理畫面\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/131e07c3a30898e626237697868d4819cc1df0a7.png\" alt=\"匯出畫面\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ea80ee5f9faa6c20a14d8e87abe9f45818e60b0d.png\" alt=\"備份畫面\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/40ca70bdd1837feee1f475485779a0d5c448161c.png\" alt=\"匯入畫面\"></p>\n<p>&lt;/details&gt;</p>\n<hr>\n<h2>快速指令（選用）</h2>\n<p>進階使用者適用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>/packcore wizard</code> — 重新開啟設定精靈</li>\n<li><code>/packcore modpack_config</code> — 開啟PackCore配置管理器</li>\n<li><code>/packcore update check</code> — 手動檢查更新</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2>專為SkyBlock增強包打造</h2>\n<h3>SkyBlock Enhanced – 現代版（1.21+）</h3>\n<p>在現代Minecraft版本上遊玩Hypixel SkyBlock，享受更佳效能與現代化介面選項。<br>\n→ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252fe0oMrxjp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/project/e0oMrxjp</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>贊助支援</h2>\n<p>若您想贊助開發：</p>\n<p>→ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkdgaming1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">☕ 在Ko-fi上贊助</a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>伺服器託管合作夥伴</h2>\n<p>需要伺服器嗎？我與Bisect Hosting合作。</p>\n<p>使用代碼 <strong>SBE</strong> 即可享首次購買<strong>75折</strong>優惠。<br>\n→ <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fSBE%253fr%253dSkyblockEnhancedModrinthPage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">🎮 透過Bisect Hosting享75折優惠</a></p>",
